  "spec_html": "<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\">本產品是一種含有 有機官能基</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\"> (</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\">甲基丙烯酰基</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\">與 矽烷官能基 的偶聯劑。適用於橡膠表面處理，可顯著提升油墨、塗料、膠黏劑在橡膠基材上的附著力與耐久性。產品可於橡膠表面形成一層活性矽烷層，作為油墨與橡膠之間的「分子橋樑」，適用於多種橡膠</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\"> (NR, SBR, NBR, EPDM, CR </span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\">等</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; text-indent: 24pt;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\"> </span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">〔特　　性〕</span></strong></span></p>\n<ol start=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"1\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">表面改質：在橡膠表面形成矽醇層，提高表面能，改善濕潤性。</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">化學結合：處理後的橡膠表面可與油墨中的丙烯酸、聚氨酯、<span lang=\"EN-US\">UV </span>固化樹脂共聚，提高結合力。</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">耐久性：顯著提升油墨對橡膠的耐磨性。</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">操作簡便：可用浸漬、噴塗或擦拭方式施工。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">〔處理方法〕</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 48.0pt; text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">   </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">浸漬法：將橡膠製品浸泡於溶液中 <span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>–<span lang=\"EN-US\">10 </span>秒鐘，取出後常溫風乾或鍾溫烘乾。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 48.0pt; text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">   </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">噴塗<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>刷塗法：均勻塗佈於橡膠表面，常溫風乾或中溫烘乾。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">〔後續加工〕</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 9.0pt; text-indent: 24.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">建議在處理後<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">3 ~ 24</span></strong>小時後印刷或塗佈油墨，效果最佳。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></p>",
